{"type":"text","timestamp":"2026-10-06T16:52:36.024Z","data":{"text":"Done.\n\n**Summary**\n\nTask 1 of change 153 adds a `diffStat` read to the `Vcs` port.\n\n- `vcs.ts`: exported `VcsDiffStat` and added `diffStat(from, to, exclude)` to `Vcs`, with the rule in its doc comment.\n- `git-vcs-diff.ts` (new): runs `git diff --numstat --no-renames <from>...<to> -- . :(exclude)<path>…` through the same read runner `countCommits` uses, sums each line as one file (`-` = 0 lines), and returns null on a non-zero exit.\n- `GitVcs.diffStat` delegates to it; `NoVcs.diffStat` returns null.\n- `tests/vcs-write.test.ts`: added `diffStat` to `PORT_MEMBERS`, nothing else.\n- `tests/vcs-diff-stat.test.ts` (new): covers all \"Vcs diff count\" scenarios plus `selectVcs` returning `NoVcs` for a folder with no git.\n\nBoth the task verify (`node --import tsx --import ./tests/git-test-env.ts --test tests/vcs-diff-stat.test.ts`) and the proposal verify (`pnpm verify`) pass; the result file is at `openspec/changes/153-land-view/.run/results/1.md`."}}
